                                "sense_id": "ecfd6f56-4606-30b1-976d-94bd1451b25c",
                                "text": "Even in beasts, that have no voice at all, by the reciprocall kindnesse, which we see in them, we easily inferre there is some other meane of entercommunication: their jestures treat, and their motions discourse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d1cd1e3-fcd8-460e-b944-01ba60e8dfb1",
                                "sense_id": "ecfd6f56-4606-30b1-976d-94bd1451b25c",
                                "text": "Starting in their different musical worlds, they attempted endless ways of achieving a partnership, at last finding some kind of \"intercommunication\"."
                            }
                        ]
